WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.309
Your bitcoin is only as safe as your keys.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.812
And most keys are kept on devices that are online.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.627
Online devices can be hacked.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.465
And hardware wallets cost money, and ship to your home address.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.609
SafeKeepVault keeps your bitcoin keys offline, using a computer you already own.

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.530
It's free, and open source.

7
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.996
Here's how it works. First, copy it onto a USB flash drive.

8
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:33.530
Next, start your computer from it. All networking and disk access are removed when it boots.

9
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.794
Then approve your payments offline.

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.404
Everything happens on a full-size screen that never goes online.

11
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.667
So you see exactly who gets paid, and how much, before you sign.

12
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.595
Your wallet app stays online. Your keys never do.

13
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:53.669
Payments pass between them by QR code or USB drive and come back signed.

14
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.270
It costs nothing.

15
00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:58.810
There's nothing to order.

16
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.911
Your backups are done properly.

17
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.349
And every line of code is public.

18
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.053
SafeKeepVault. Get it free at safekeepbitcoin.com.

